# =============================================================================
# SecureLocker - .gitignore
# Ignore build artifacts, IDE droppings and OS/cloud junk. Source files and the
# Keil project (majorproject12.uvproj / majorproject12.sct / Startup.s) are
# committed deliberately so the repo builds out of the box.
# =============================================================================

# --- Keil uVision build artifacts -------------------------------------------
*.o
*.crf
*.d
*.axf
*.map
*.lst
*.htm
*.dep
*.bak
*.lnp
*.tra
*.plg
*.uvopt
*.uvgui.*

# The stale / 0-byte / broken Keil files from an older machine are never
# committed. The LIVE project is majorproject12.uvproj + majorproject12.sct,
# which ARE tracked.
majorproject.uvproj
majorproject.uvopt
majorproject.sct

# --- ARM compiler / linker droppings ----------------------------------------
*.elf
*.bin
*.out
*.log

# --- IDE / editor -----------------------------------------------------------
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.suo
*.user

# --- OS junk ----------------------------------------------------------------
Thumbs.db
Desktop.ini
.DS_Store

# --- OneDrive / cloud sync junk ---------------------------------------------
*.one
*.onetoc2
*.tmp
